Linux (á PC):
    1. Fara í Part2 möppuna:
cd ~/Desktop/VSCodium_container/Project5/Part2

    2. Compile-a userspace app í .deb (64-bit Pi Zero 2 W):
mkdir -p userspace_app/deb/usr/local/bin
zig c++ -target arm-linux-gnueabihf -mcpu=cortex_a53 -fno-sanitize=undefined \
userspace_app/build/src/main.cpp \
userspace_app/build/src/drive.cpp \
userspace_app/build/src/P_controller.cpp \
userspace_app/build/src/PI_controller.cpp \
userspace_app/build/src/setpoint_generator.cpp \
-Iuserspace_app/build/include \
-Luserspace_app/lib -lgpiod \
-o userspace_app/deb/usr/local/bin/project5
dpkg-deb --build userspace_app/deb userspace_app/project5.deb
scp userspace_app/project5.deb olafursj23@10.42.0.1:~/
    (Ef 64-bit Pi OS: sækja 64-bit libgpiod.so einu sinni af Pi með:
     scp username@ip:/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libgpiod.so userspace_app/lib/
     Ef 32-bit Pi OS á Zero 2 W: nota -target arm-linux-gnueabihf í stað aarch64-linux-gnu)

    3. Senda bæði app og kernel module á Pi:
scp userspace_app/project5.deb olafursj23@10.42.0.1:~/
scp -r kernel_module username@ip:~/


Á Raspberry Pi:
    1. Installa pakka og græja dependencies (bara gert einu sinni):
sudo apt update
sudo apt install ~/project5.deb linux-headers-$(uname -r) device-tree-compiler

    2. Compile-a og hlaða inn kernel module:
cd ~/kernel_module
make
sudo dtoverlay part2_overlay.dtbo
sudo insmod part2module.ko
sudo chmod 666 /dev/encoder

sudo dtoverlay pwm-2chan pin=12 func=4 pin2=13 func=4
echo 0 | sudo tee /sys/class/pwm/pwmchip0/export
echo 1 | sudo tee /sys/class/pwm/pwmchip0/export
echo 50000 | sudo tee /sys/class/pwm/pwmchip0/pwm0/period
echo 50000 | sudo tee /sys/class/pwm/pwmchip0/pwm1/period
echo 0 | sudo tee /sys/class/pwm/pwmchip0/pwm0/duty_cycle
echo 0 | sudo tee /sys/class/pwm/pwmchip0/pwm1/duty_cycle
echo 1 | sudo tee /sys/class/pwm/pwmchip0/pwm0/enable
echo 1 | sudo tee /sys/class/pwm/pwmchip0/pwm1/enable
sudo chmod 666 /sys/class/pwm/pwmchip0/pwm0/duty_cycle
sudo chmod 666 /sys/class/pwm/pwmchip0/pwm1/duty_cycle

    3. Keyra í terminal (t.d. 100.0 RPM):
project5 100.0


Pinout (Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W):
Encoder A (enca):       GPIO 27 - Pin 13    Input (interrupt)
Encoder B (encb):       GPIO 22 - Pin 15    Input
Motor PWM Fwd (pwm0):   GPIO 12 - Pin 32    Output (PWM0)
Motor PWM Rev (pwm1):   GPIO 13 - Pin 33    Output (PWM1)
Driver Sleep (slp_pin): GPIO 25 - Pin 22    Output (gpiod)

